    even in a HEALTHY state (input-size/runtime limit, NOT correctness) -- it is a FALSE signal that nearly caused a
    wrong revert. The CANONICAL rz==rc gate is s1-ast-diff.sh's FIXTURES BOOTSTRAP (+ small targeted inputs). NEVER
    diagnose an AST change from the self-dump.
  - FINDING S1-F2 (finding-#4 refinement): ADDING FIELDS to an existing ExprK variant (Closure) is stage0-SAFE (verified
